:259:## Artifact GER\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/02_RAG_SCANNER_CONTEXT.md:274:### Canon / Design Evaluator\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/02_RAG_SCANNER_CONTEXT.md:283:### Completeness Evaluator\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/02_RAG_SCANNER_CONTEXT.md:291:### Style Evaluator — Assignment 7\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/02_RAG_SCANNER_CONTEXT.md:319:## Artifact Promotion\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/02_RAG_SCANNER_CONTEXT.md:348:## Re-Decomposition\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/02_RAG_SCANNER_CONTEXT.md:360:## Token-Saving Goal\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/02_RAG_SCANNER_CONTEXT.md:372:## Completion Criteria\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/02_RAG_SCANNER_CONTEXT.md:385:## Next\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/02_RAG_SCANNER_CONTEXT.md:391:## Reconciliation Boundary\nAI_PIPELINE.md:1:# No Safe Circle AI Pipeline\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/START_HERE.md:1:# START HERE — No Safe Circle AI Pipeline\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/START_HERE.md:5:## Purpose\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/START_HERE.md:11:## Current Status Snapshot\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/START_HERE.md:62:## Required Reading Order\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/START_HERE.md:82:## Milestone Routing Table\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/START_HERE.md:95:## Milestone 1 Commands\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/START_HERE.md:109:## Current First Real Task Anchor\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/START_HERE.md:119:## Important GER Lesson\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/START_HERE.md:137:## Important Progressive-Decomposition Lesson\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/START_HERE.md:152:## Important Artifact-Authority Lesson\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/START_HERE.md:176:## Important Reconciliation-Snapshot Lesson\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/START_HERE.md:190:## Independent Reconciliation Verification Gate\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/START_HERE.md:207:## Current-Output Convention\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/START_HERE.md:223:## Core Principle\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/START_HERE.md:233:## Current Development Rule\nDocs/AI-Pipeline/START_HERE.md:253:## End-of-Session Rule\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
