{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_24","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"wc -l Pipeline/Reconciliation/prompts/reconcile.md Pipeline/Reconciliation/prompts/verification/*.md && git log --oneline -- Pipeline/Reconciliation/prompts | head -n 50 && git log --format='%h %ad %s' --date=short -- Pipeline/Reconciliation | head -n 80\"","aggregated_output":"4736efa Fixes the fresh reconciliation boundary failure caused by the global pipeline worker legitimately inspecting the repository’s root .gitignore.\n4300e95 Make cumulative installer tolerate materialized fresh-run fixes\nb2cc2f6 Close fresh-run reconciliation verification gaps\ne8d0aca Close fresh-run reconciliation verification gaps\n90fdb15 Merged in final provenance verification\na94212f Refine streaming verification and close remaining graph gaps\n4aa2a81 Add reconciliation evidence guard and recovery\n2b084d1 Add streaming verification refinement and closure fixes\n2edee13 Bound reconciliation refinement and raise evidence audit turns\ndfea31a Harden verification dependency and writer-lock semantics\n40040fb Harden spell reset and feedback closure\ndc4a95d Close final verification false positives\ncce5a2c Harden final graph-edge ownership\n938e6de Harden verification semantics and coverage\n7e00645 Harden reconciliation canonical coverage\n069d23c Align package-lock evidence boundary\n852d08c Close verification ownership and process gaps\nd8a6a89 Clarify restart, victory, and navigation ownership\n5d70093 Harden reconciliation dependency preflight\nf6fe091 Clarify build, navigation, feedback, and graph prerequisites\ne1bc32a Clarify shared gameplay ownership and reconciliation boundaries\nd82cca2 Fix exclusive resource key validation in reconciliation verification\n3fb34ab Normalize contradictory reconciliation execution scope\nb2bfaa9 Add typed non-code requirements and structural refinement\nde86121 Add requirement representation taxonomy\n42c799e Allow Unity package manifest as re