6-08-20 Raise parallel verification auditors to 24 turns / Raise parallel reconciliation workers to 24 turns\n9523612 2026-08-20 Add max-turn recovery to parallel reconciliation\ne8a207f 2026-08-20 Add max-turn recovery to parallel verification\nce3d052 2026-08-20 Allow for more concurrency for the verification and reconciliation\n73540ee 2026-08-20 Add complete routing registry to parallel reconciliation\n144c1ba 2026-08-20 Clean up parallel reconciliation console output\na5e2c28 2026-08-20 Add domain-parallel verification pipeline\naffff2e 2026-08-20 Add domain-parallel reconciliation pipeline\ndfea31a 2026-08-20 Harden verification dependency and writer-lock semantics\n40040fb 2026-08-20 Harden spell reset and feedback closure\ndc4a95d 2026-08-20 Close final verification false positives\ncce5a2c 2026-08-20 Harden final graph-edge ownership\n938e6de 2026-08-20 Harden verification semantics and coverage\n7e00645 2026-08-20 Harden reconciliation canonical coverage\n069d23c 2026-08-20 Align package-lock evidence boundary\n852d08c 2026-08-20 Close verification ownership and process gaps\nd8a6a89 2026-08-20 Clarify restart, victory, and navigation ownership\n5d70093 2026-08-20 Harden reconciliation dependency preflight\nf6fe091 2026-08-19 Clarify build, navigation, feedback, and graph prerequisites\ne1bc32a 2026-08-19 Clarify shared gameplay ownership and reconciliation boundaries\nd82cca2 2026-08-19 Fix exclusive resource key validation in reconciliation verification\n3fb34ab 2026-08-19 Normalize contradictory reconciliation execution scope\nb2bfaa9 2026-08-19 Add typed non-code requirements and structural refinement\nde86121 2026-08-19 Add requirement representation taxonomy\nd17ac45 2026-08-19 Improve verification Refiner sizing and recovery\n42c799e 2026-08-19 Allow Unity package manifest as reconciliation evidence\n5bf289c 2026-08-19 Add execution-scope auditing and simplify reconciliation outputs\n1355db9 2026-08-19 Add verification recovery for refined reconciliation runs\n58a757f 2026-08-19 Add multi-model reconciliation verification crew\nf651627 2026-08-19 Make reconciliation outputs immutable and add graph-delta boundary\n6465b1b 2026-08-18 Add structural repair for dangling reconciliation dependencies\nd307b1d 2026-08-18 Harden reconciliation source boundaries\nc262902 2026-08-18 Fix reconciliation dependency validation and preserve raw output\n03749c5 2026-08-18 Add reconciliation agent for work graph bootstrap\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
